              "stdout": "<class 'list'> [{'type': 'web_search_result', 'title': 'The British School of Nanjing', 'url': 'https://www.nordangliaeducation.com/bsn-nanjing', 'content': \"Part of the Nord Anglia family of premium schools, **BSN is the longest running British international school in Nanjing** with a remarkable record of academic success.\\n\\nExplore The British School of Nanjing (BSN), China, the longest running premium international school in Nanjing and part of the Nord Anglia family.\\n\\n# THE BRITISH SCHOOL OF NANJING (BSN)\\nPart of the Nord Anglia family of premium schools, BSN is the longest running British international school in Nanjing with a remarkable record of academic success.\\n\\nAt The British School of Nanjing (BSN), your child will achieve remarkable academic results. Our students go to the best universities in the world, which is thanks to the exceptional learning experiences we offer, our world-class teachers, and curriculum pathways that are personalised to your child’s talents and passions.\\n\\nAt BSN NANJING, we teach students how to learn, encouraging them to think critically about their own learning processes, which is a fundamental part of metacognition.\\n\\nThe British School of Nanjing | Nord Anglia Education - Feature Cards Pattern\\n\\nThe British School of Nanjing | Nord Anglia Education - Feature Cards Pattern\\n\\nUsed by more than 30,000 schools worldwide, the curriculum is globally respected by the best universities.\\n\\nOur global languages department, for example, developed an award-winning programme that has seen two of our students achieve ‘best in the world’ IGCSE results in Mandarin.\\n\\nWorld's best teachers\\n\\nOutstanding teachers shape lives, which is why we recruit the most talented British and international educators from across the globe.\", 'page_age': '1554 days ago'}, {'type': 'web_search_result', 'title': 'Nanjing International School', 'url': 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nanjing_International_School', 'content': '- Xue Heng Lu 8, Xian Lin College and University Town, Qi Xia District, Nanjing PRC 210023 中国南京市栖霞区仙林大学城学衡路8号 邮编:210023 Nanjing Qixia District, Jiangsu China\\n\\n- Type: International School (non-profit)\\n\\n|Nanjing International School\\n\\nNanjing International School is a non-profit\\n[International school](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_school) in Xian Lin College and University Town (仙林大学城), [Qixia District](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qixia_District), [Nanjing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nanjing), enrolling children age 3 to 18 from Pre-Kindergarten to Grade 12.\\n\\nInitially, the school was named Nanjing American School and had five students ranging from Grades 1 to 5. In 1996, the school was officially registered by the Nanjing authorities and changed its name to Nanjing International School.\\nAfter three years of operating in rented rooms at the Nanjing Foreign Language School (NFLS), the enrollment at Nanjing International School grew, requiring more space than the two classrooms at NFLS.\\n\\nBetween 199\n",
